00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.450
This will boost economic activity.

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:39.450
This is the "mechanism" behind economic activity.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.160
In the short-term debt cycle, the factors influencing spending are the degree to which lenders and borrowers are willing to

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:47.140
