00:13:56.090 --> 00:14:00.450
This cycle is primarily controlled by the central bank.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:05.120
The cycle for short-term debt is generally 5 to 8 years.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.410
And this cycle repeats itself for decades.  What I want you to pay

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.410
attention to here is that the

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.400
